{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09657","headline":"郡斋闲坐 · 岑参","name":"郡斋闲坐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"负郭无良田，屈身狥微禄。\n平生好疎旷，何事就羁束。\n幸曾趋丹墀，数得侍黄屋。\n故人尽荣宠，谁念此幽独。\n州县非宿心，云山欣满目。\n顷来废章句，终日披案牍。\n佐郡竟何成，自悲徒碌碌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09657.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09657","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}